# Explicit closing-Flow FARGAN topology. Imported checked Value declarations
# retain the exact finite Types; every invocation/state/value port here is Flow.
# Resource tensor ports remain immutable Value inputs admitted once per owner.
# Generic owners repeat only through their distinct closing-Flow contracts.
# This Source declares reusable ordering; scheduler/state-feedback proof is separate.

# Conditioning-only topology from xiph/opus
# 503d81b138d76621aae4b12786e90de48aa8db3a, dnn/fargan.c.
# Generic numeric kinds have independent owned contracts and bounded Backs.
# This Source establishes topology, not executable synthesis or model admission.
# Matrix profiles carry immutable resource references, content digest, f32 element,
# and exact [input, output] dimensions in input-major order. Model admission
# must correlate these profiles with the ordinary TensorValue/ModelArtifact owners.
# Selected upstream features0..17 are eighteen log-band cepstral coefficients
# (smoothed log10(.01+energy), DCT, coefficient0 shifted by−4); feature18 is
# log2(256/period)−1.5; feature19 is softplus(5*normalized correlation)/softplus(5)−.5.
# The36-feature training/scratch carrier additionally contains16 LPC values;
# these are not network inputs. A source-correlated speech-plan feature producer
# must separately identify and validate its conditioning approximation/profile.
# This numerical topology does not establish that producer or intelligibility.
# Features arrive at 100 Hz. History is the two prior dense/tanh vectors.
# The three-frame window produces conditioning centered one frame before input.
# Caller stages next_history and next_period and commits only with accepted PCM.
# Numeric Types are imported from the AI fixed_numeric owner catalog.

# The admitted period range yields 0..223. Generic lookup checks its own
# index bound; offset policy is this authored subtraction, not primitive code.
plot speech/flow-fargan-period-index (
    >> value: FarganPeriod...|
    result: U16...| >>
) = (. - 32)

plot speech/flow-fargan-period-identity (
    >> value: FarganPeriod...|
    result: FarganPeriod...| >>
) = (.)

plot speech/flow-fargan-conditioning (
    >> features: NumericF32Vector20...|
    >> period: FarganPeriod...|
    >> previous_period: FarganPeriod...|
    >> history: NumericHistory2x64...|
    >> embedding_weights: NumericEmbedding224x12
    >> dense1_weights: NumericF32MatrixRef32x64
    >> dense1_bias: NumericF32BiasRef64
    >> conv_weights: NumericF32MatrixRef192x128
    >> conv_bias: NumericF32BiasRef128
    >> dense2_weights: NumericF32MatrixRef128x320
    >> dense2_bias: NumericF32BiasRef320
    condition: NumericF32Vector320...| >>
    next_history: NumericHistory2x64...| >>
    conditioned_period: FarganPeriod...| >>
    next_period: FarganPeriod...| >>
) {
    pitch_index: speech/flow-fargan-period-index
    embedding: numeric/flow-embedding224x12
    concatenate: numeric/flow-concatenate20x12
    dense1: numeric/flow-dense32x64
    activate1: numeric/flow-tanh64
    window: numeric/flow-history2x64
    convolution: numeric/flow-dense192x128
    activate2: numeric/flow-tanh128
    dense2: numeric/flow-dense128x320
    activate3: numeric/flow-tanh320
    delayed_pitch: speech/flow-fargan-period-identity
    retained_pitch: speech/flow-fargan-period-identity
    period >> pitch_index.value
    pitch_index.result >> embedding.index
    embedding_weights >> embedding.weights
    features >> concatenate.left
    embedding.result >> concatenate.right
    concatenate.result >> dense1.value
    dense1_weights >> dense1.weights
    dense1_bias >> dense1.bias
    dense1.result >> activate1.value
    activate1.result >> window.value
    history >> window.history
    window.result >> (.next_history) >> next_history
    window.result >> (.window) >> convolution.value
    conv_weights >> convolution.weights
    conv_bias >> convolution.bias
    convolution.result >> activate2.value
    activate2.result >> dense2.value
    dense2_weights >> dense2.weights
    dense2_bias >> dense2.bias
    dense2.result >> activate3.value
    activate3.result >> condition
    previous_period >> delayed_pitch.value
    delayed_pitch.result >> conditioned_period
    period >> retained_pitch.value
    retained_pitch.result >> next_period
}
